A sale posted after the acquisition has no negative holding warning.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ accounts: ['^Assets:Fund$'], to: '2024-01-02' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.000 FUND
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Fund

2024-01-01 Buy fund
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND {100 SEK} ; [2024-01-03]
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK

2024-01-02 Sell fund
  Assets:Fund  -1 FUND {100 SEK} @ 100 SEK ; [2024-01-03]
  Assets:Cash  100 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[]

========== WARNINGS ==========


